   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the highway law, in relation to designating a portion of the\nstate highway system as the \"Westchester Purple Heart Highway\"",
    "basePrintNo": "S6930",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6930-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Add §342-aaa, Hway L",
    "lawSection": "Highway Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S6930\n\nSPONSOR: HARCKHAM\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the highway law, in relation to designating a portion of\nthe state highway system as the \"Westchester Purple Heart Highway\"\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nDesignates a portion of the state highway system as the \"Purple Heart\nTrail\"  \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 designates the boundaries of the state highway system to be\nknown as the \"Purple Heart Trail.\"\n\nSection 2 outlines how the commissioner of transportation and munici-\npalities shall work in tandem for the placement of necessary designation\nsignage, and clarifies that the name change is ceremonial in nature not\nrequiring maps, surveys, or routes to adapt.\n\nSection 3: states the effective date\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThere are several cornerstones of America ingrained into what and who we\nare; chief amongst them are our veterans and highways. Millions of New\nYorkers everyday commute and travel on an intricate system of highways,\nwhich were largely constructed as part of the New Deal during the Great\nDepression. While the labor and engineering to establish our everyday\ntransportation network is owed to the Greatest Generation of Americans,\nit would all be for naught without the veterans who fought for this\nnation to be freed and kept free. This legislation showcases the incred-\nible sacrifices that Purple Heart veterans endured for America in a\nplace and manner that millions will engage with and appreciate.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2023-2024: S9301A - Passed Senate\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTBD\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
